{"type":"text","timestamp":1790451427361,"sessionID":"ses_f20cb0830ffetdMOmwjc45P2MA","part":{"id":"prt_0df38a814001G20Ed7GkkP2Rqx","messageID":"msg_0df387790001ll439WBsFCj2kw","sessionID":"ses_f20cb0830ffetdMOmwjc45P2MA","type":"text","text":"All done. The game runs cleanly in Godot 4.4.1 with no script errors, and all requirements are implemented:\n\n**`scenes/world.tscn`**\n- TileSet sub-resource now has `custom_data_layer_0/name = \"tile_type\"` with `type = 2` (int)\n- World node has `water_color`, `dirt_color`, `grass_color` assigned to `GradientTexture1D` sub-resources (each backed by a Gradient with blue/brown/green ramps)\n\n**`scripts/world.gd`**\n- `enum TILE_TYPES { NONE, WATER, DIRT, GRASS }`\n- `@export var water_color/dirt_color/grass_color: GradientTexture1D`\n- `tile_type_gradients` dictionary built in `_ready()` mapping each TILE_TYPES value to its gradient\n- Static `get_gradient_at(position)` reads `get_custom_data_at(position, \"tile_type\")` and returns the matching gradient\n\n**`scenes/tank.tscn`**\n- `LeftTrackParticles` and `RightTrackParticles` GPUParticles2D nodes, each with a `ParticleProcessMaterial`:\n  - `emission_shape = 1` (box), `emission_box_extents.x = -16`\n  - `direction.y = -16` (left) / `+16` (right)\n  - `spread = 25`, `gravity = Vector3.ZERO`, `initial_velocity_max = 4`, `damping_max = 3`, `scale_min = 0.25`\n  - `amount = 128`, `z_index = -1`, `emitting = false`\n\n**`scripts/tank.gd`**\n- Tracks `current_gradient` each physics frame via `World.get_gradient_at(position)`\n- Assigns it to both emitters' `process_material.color_ramp`\n- Sets both emitters `emitting = true` while driving input is active, `false` otherwise\n\nVerified via headless scene-instantiation tests (custom layer present, exports assigned, particle properties exact, singleton/dictionary runtime behavior correct) and a recorded screenshot of the running game. Temporary output files were cleaned up.","time":{"start":1790451427348,"end":1790451427349},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_e3110ccba7394628b524b62747b13053_msg"}}}}
